Boost/Graph version 1.5
========================

The Boost::Graph module, Perl interface to the Boost-Graph libraries

INSTALLATION

To Install this module, type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

Installation works as with any other CPAN distribution.
If you would like to use a different version of Boost, set the BOOST environment variable

See http://www.boost.org/libs/graph/doc/


DEPENDENCIES

This module requires the C++ Boost Graph Library to be installed. You can download it for free, here:
http://www.boost.org/libs/graph/doc/

